{"id":"a3e001d6d4df5f5c","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/884_FL_w.md","title":"884 FL w","display":"884_FL_w","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<h1 id=\"884-FL_w\">884 FL_w</h1>\n<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}\\)</span> 为固定可数无限原子集合。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv},\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{join}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv},\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{join}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第 2 节定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv},\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{join}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv},\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{join}\\)</span> 八个构造子生成的最小闭包。其型别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{zero}\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{zero}\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv},\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{join}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv},\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{join}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>FL_w 在后文把左弱化结构规则加入 Full Lambek 语言，交换与收缩关系取空集。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式与替换\">2. 公式与替换</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 是最小集合，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{zero}\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{zero}\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{join}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{join}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{one})=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{zero})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{one})=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{zero})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{prod}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{prod}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\sigma]\">\\(A[\\sigma]\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{one}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{one},\\quad\n\\operatorname{zero}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{zero},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{one}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{one},\\quad\n\\operatorname{zero}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{zero},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{prod}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{prod}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{ldiv}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{ldiv}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{rdiv}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{rdiv}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{meet}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{meet}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{join}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{join}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{join}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{join}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。定义绑定原子函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>固定新鲜原子选择函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任一原子重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由于没有绑定名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}\\)</span> 均是捕获避免替换。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{FLw}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{FLw}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-上下文与序列\">3. 上下文与序列</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{List}\">\\(\\mathsf{List}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 上有限列表集合，序列为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}=\\{\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Seq}=\\{\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\\)</span>。令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Seq}^n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Seq}^n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理\">4. 公理</h1>\n<p>公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}=\\{A\\Rightarrow A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\\cup\\{\\epsilon\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{one}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}=\\{A\\Rightarrow A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\\cup\\{\\epsilon\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{one}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-逻辑规则\">5. 逻辑规则</h1>\n<p>以下每个规则族都是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}\">\\(\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}\\)</span> 的子集，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((S_0,\\ldots,S_{n-1});S)\">\\(((S_0,\\ldots,S_{n-1});S)\\)</span> 表示前提列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(S_0,\\ldots,S_{n-1})\">\\((S_0,\\ldots,S_{n-1})\\)</span> 与结论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{log}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{log}}\\)</span> 为下列集合的并：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\Delta\\Rightarrow B);\\Gamma\\cdot\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)):\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\Delta\\Rightarrow B);\\Gamma\\cdot\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)):\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{((\\Gamma,A,B,\\Delta\\Rightarrow C);\\Gamma,\\operatorname{prod}(A,B),\\Delta\\Rightarrow C):\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{((\\Gamma,A,B,\\Delta\\Rightarrow C);\\Gamma,\\operatorname{prod}(A,B),\\Delta\\Rightarrow C):\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{((A,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow B);\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{((A,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow B);\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{((\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow B);\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiv}(B,A)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{((\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow B);\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiv}(B,A)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow B);\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow B);\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A);\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{join}(A,B)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow B);\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{join}(A,B)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A);\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{join}(A,B)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow B);\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{join}(A,B)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>补全左规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L}=\n\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\Delta,B,\\Pi\\Rightarrow C);\\Delta,\\Gamma,\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B),\\Pi\\Rightarrow C):\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L}=\n\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\Delta,B,\\Pi\\Rightarrow C);\\Delta,\\Gamma,\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B),\\Pi\\Rightarrow C):\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}=\n\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\Delta,B,\\Pi\\Rightarrow C);\\Delta,\\operatorname{rdiv}(B,A),\\Gamma,\\Pi\\Rightarrow C):\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}=\n\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\Delta,B,\\Pi\\Rightarrow C);\\Delta,\\operatorname{rdiv}(B,A),\\Gamma,\\Pi\\Rightarrow C):\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{1L}=\n\\{((\\Gamma,\\Delta\\Rightarrow C);\\Gamma,\\operatorname{one},\\Delta\\Rightarrow C):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{List},C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{1L}=\n\\{((\\Gamma,\\Delta\\Rightarrow C);\\Gamma,\\operatorname{one},\\Delta\\Rightarrow C):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{List},C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\wedge L_i}=\n\\{((\\Gamma,A_i,\\Delta\\Rightarrow C);\\Gamma,\\operatorname{meet}(A_0,A_1),\\Delta\\Rightarrow C):\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{List},A_0,A_1,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm},i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\wedge L_i}=\n\\{((\\Gamma,A_i,\\Delta\\Rightarrow C);\\Gamma,\\operatorname{meet}(A_0,A_1),\\Delta\\Rightarrow C):\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{List},A_0,A_1,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm},i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\vee L}=\n\\{((\\Gamma,A,\\Delta\\Rightarrow C),(\\Gamma,B,\\Delta\\Rightarrow C);\\Gamma,\\operatorname{join}(A,B),\\Delta\\Rightarrow C):\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\vee L}=\n\\{((\\Gamma,A,\\Delta\\Rightarrow C),(\\Gamma,B,\\Delta\\Rightarrow C);\\Gamma,\\operatorname{join}(A,B),\\Delta\\Rightarrow C):\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{0L}=\n\\{(();\\Gamma,\\operatorname{zero},\\Delta\\Rightarrow C):\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{List},C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{0L}=\n\\{(();\\Gamma,\\operatorname{zero},\\Delta\\Rightarrow C):\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{List},C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{log}}^+\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{log}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{1L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\wedge L_0}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\wedge L_1}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\vee L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{0L}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{log}}^+\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{log}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{1L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\wedge L_0}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\wedge L_1}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\vee L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{0L}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-结构规则\">6. 结构规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{wk}}=\n\\{((\\Gamma,\\Delta\\Rightarrow B);\\Gamma,A,\\Delta\\Rightarrow B):\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{wk}}=\n\\{((\\Gamma,\\Delta\\Rightarrow B);\\Gamma,A,\\Delta\\Rightarrow B):\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ex}}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctr}}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ex}}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctr}}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}=\n\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\Delta,A,\\Pi\\Rightarrow B);\\Delta,\\Gamma,\\Pi\\Rightarrow B):\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}=\n\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\Delta,A,\\Pi\\Rightarrow B);\\Delta,\\Gamma,\\Pi\\Rightarrow B):\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{log}}^+\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{wk}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ex}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctr}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{log}}^+\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{wk}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ex}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctr}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义结构规则汇总</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{struct},\\mathsf{FLw}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{wk}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ex}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctr}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{struct},\\mathsf{FLw}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{wk}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ex}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctr}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}T^n\">\\(T^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}T^n\\)</span>。FL_w 证明树是五元组\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\">\\((T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 有限非空，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in T\">\\(r\\in T\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}:T\\to T^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}:T\\to T^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 的值无重复项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}(t)\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}(t)\\)</span> 中当且仅当\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\prec t\">\\(u\\prec t\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 无父节点，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\ne r\">\\(u\\ne r\\)</span> 有唯一父节点，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span> 无环且所有节点沿有限链到达 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>；\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}\">\\(\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}(t)=(t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1})\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}(t)=(t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1})\\)</span>，定义\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}(\\Gamma,A)\">\\(\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}(\\Gamma,A)\\)</span> 为满足下列条件的这种五元组集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell(r)=\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell(r)=\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in T\">\\(t\\in T\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"n=0\\Rightarrow\\bigl(\\ell(t)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}\\ \\lor\\ (();\\ell(t))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{0L}\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[n=0\\Rightarrow\\bigl(\\ell(t)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}\\ \\lor\\ (();\\ell(t))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{0L}\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\\Rightarrow((\\ell(t_0),\\ldots,\\ell(t_{n-1}));\\ell(t))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[n&gt;0\\Rightarrow((\\ell(t_0),\\ldots,\\ell(t_{n-1}));\\ell(t))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可导性\">8. 可导性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{FLw}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{FLw}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义可导相继式集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}\n=\n\\{\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathsf{Seq}:\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{FLw}}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}\n=\n\\{\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathsf{Seq}:\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{FLw}}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathsf{Seq}\">\\(S\\in\\mathsf{Seq}\\)</span> 定义证明对象索引</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}(S)\n=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}(\\Gamma,A),&amp;S=(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;S\\notin\\mathsf{Seq}.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}(S)\n=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}(\\Gamma,A),&amp;S=(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;S\\notin\\mathsf{Seq}.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义证明证书集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}(\\Gamma,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}(\\Gamma,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标差异\">9. 目标差异</h1>\n<p>本条目的目标差异是：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{wk}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{wk}}\\)</span> 允许在前件任意位置插入一个公式，而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ex}}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctr}}=\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ex}}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctr}}=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>FL_w 的结构差异对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{wk}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ex}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctr}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{struct},\\mathsf{FLw}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{wk}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ex}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctr}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{struct},\\mathsf{FLw}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-整个形式系统\">10. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{FLw}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{FLw}},\\operatorname{Sub},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{FLw}},\\mathsf{List},\\mathsf{Seq},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{FLw}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{wk}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ex}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctr}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{struct},\\mathsf{FLw}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{FLw}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{FLw}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{FLw}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{FLw}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{FLw}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{FLw}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{FLw}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{FLw}},\\operatorname{Sub},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{FLw}},\\mathsf{List},\\mathsf{Seq},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{FLw}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{wk}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ex}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctr}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{struct},\\mathsf{FLw}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{FLw}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{FLw}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{FLw}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{FLw}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{FLw}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{FLw}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{FLw}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只定义 FL_w 的句法证明关系；不含交换、收缩、代数语义或完备性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"884-FL_w","text":"884 FL_w","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式与替换","text":"2. 公式与替换","level":1},{"id":"3.-上下文与序列","text":"3. 上下文与序列","le